   "title": "Bezos's Regret-Minimization Framework: Leaving a Great Job to Sell Books Online",
   "hook": "Bezos decided to quit a top Wall Street job by imagining himself at 80 looking back.",
   "source": "The Everything Store — Brad Stone",
