   "title": "Why Drug Dealers Still Live with Their Moms",
   "hook": "A crack gang's real account books showed that most of its dealers earned less than minimum wage.",
   "source": "Freakonomics — Steven Levitt & Stephen Dubner (Ch. 3, \"Why Do Drug Dealers Still Live with Their Moms?\")",
