   "title": "Facebook in Myanmar: When an Algorithm Takes a Side",
   "hook": "No engineer set out to fuel ethnic violence, but an algorithm built to boost engagement helped spread hatred against the Rohingya.",
   "source": "Nexus — Yuval Noah Harari",
