   "title": "Your Busiest Product Line Might Be Losing You Money",
   "hook": "When Koch's consulting teams broke profits down by customer and product, companies often found that a small slice paid for everything, and some of the rest destroyed value.",
   "source": "The 80/20 Principle — Richard Koch",
   "book": "The 80/20 Principle",
