   "title": "The Keeper Test: \"Would You Fight to Keep Them?\"",
   "hook": "Netflix managers ask one blunt question about each person on their team, and it changes how they think about loyalty.",
   "source": "No Rules Rules — Reed Hastings & Erin Meyer",
