   "title": "PayPal Won by Starting Tiny: eBay's PowerSellers",
   "hook": "PayPal didn't try to win \"online payments.\" First it won a few thousand eBay sellers.",
   "source": "Zero to One — Peter Thiel (Ch. 5, \"Last Mover Advantage\")",
