   "title": "Qwikster: The Mistake Everyone Saw but Nobody Stopped",
   "hook": "Netflix's CEO pushed through a plan that angered customers, and later found out many employees had doubted it all along.",
   "source": "No Rules Rules — Reed Hastings & Erin Meyer",
