   "hook": "After a firefight where SEALs and Iraqi soldiers shot at each other, the commander walked into the debrief and blamed only himself, and his standing went up.",
   "source": "Extreme Ownership — Jocko Willink & Leif Babin (Ch. 1, \"Extreme Ownership\")",
