   "title": "The First Name in History Belonged to an Accountant",
   "hook": "The oldest known signature in human history isn't a king's or a poet's: it's on a clay receipt for barley, signed by someone called Kushim.",
   "source": "Sapiens — Yuval Noah Harari (Ch. 7, \"Memory Overload\")",
