   "title": "Peugeot Doesn't Exist (and Yet It Builds Cars)",
   "hook": "A car company has no body, no address it can't move, and no single owner, yet thousands of strangers work together for it every day.",
   "source": "Sapiens — Yuval Noah Harari (Ch. 2, \"The Tree of Knowledge\")",
