   "hook": "The data showed that sumo wrestlers in a sacred sport were quietly trading wins, and that some Chicago teachers were changing their students' tests.",
   "source": "Freakonomics — Steven Levitt & Stephen Dubner (Ch. 1, \"What Do Schoolteachers and Sumo Wrestlers Have in Common?\")",
