   "title": "Sylvia Plath, Town Gas, and the Power of Context",
   "hook": "When Britain switched to a less toxic kind of household gas, suicides dropped, and they didn't simply move elsewhere.",
   "source": "Talking to Strangers — Malcolm Gladwell",
